ard blocks %block_penalty_ranged% less damage.", "Guard does not affect units that have been affected by Guard within Crimson Guard's cooldown."], "attributes": ["+ 250 Health", "+ 12 Health Regeneration", "+ 6 Armor"], "is_item": true, "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "item"}, {"mechanism": "damage_block", "condition": "item"}]}, {"subject": "cyclone", "name_zh": "Eul的神圣法杖", "name_en": "Eul's Scepter of Divinity", "description_en": "Active: Cyclone  Sweeps a target unit up into a cyclone, making them invulnerable for %cyclone_duration% seconds. Cyclone can only be cast on enemy units or yourself.  Enemy units take %tooltip_drop_damage% magical damage upon landing. Dispel Type:  Basic Dispel", "notes_en": ["You cannot cyclone allies.", "Cyclones cast on yourself go through spell immunity.", "Cyclone can dispel some buffs and debuffs.", "Cyclone duration is unaffected by status resistance."], "attributes": ["+ 10 Intelligence", "+ 2.5 Mana Regeneration", "+ 20 Movement Speed"], "is_item": true, "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "item"}, {"mechanism": "applies_basic_dispel", "condition": "item"}, {"mechanism": "cyclone_banish", "condition": "item"}, {"mechanism": "cyclone_banish", "condition": "item"}, {"mechanism": "invulnerable_untargetable", "condition": "item"}, {"mechanism": "mana_gain", "condition": "item"}]}, {"subject": "dagon", "name_zh": "达贡之神力", "name_en": "Dagon", "description_en": "Active: Energy Burst  Emits a powerful burst of magical damage upon a targeted enemy unit. Upgradable.  Damage: %damage%  Mana Cost: %mana_cost_tooltip%", "notes_en": ["Instantly kills illusions.", "Cast Range bonuses from Aether Lens and Dagon do not stack."], "attributes": ["+ 6 / 7 / 8 / 9 / 10 All Attributes", "+ 200 / 210 / 220 / 230 / 240 Health", "+ 350 / 375 / 400 / 425 / 450 Mana", "+ 60 / 90 / 120 / 150 / 180 Cast Range"], "is_item": true, "judge": [{"mechanism": "execute", "condition": "item"}]}, {"subject": "dagon_2", "name_zh": "达